# Normalize line endings across platforms. Store LF in the repository and check
# out LF on every OS (Windows included) so tooling that asserts LF is consistent
# everywhere: Prettier runs with endOfLine "lf", gofmt/golangci-lint expect LF,
# and CI (Linux) already checks out LF. Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF and `npm run format:check` fails
# locally while passing in CI. text=auto lets git auto-detect binary files and
# leave them untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
